            "review_title": "Review at Star Cafe",
            "review_text": "Amariah B\nSydney, Australia182 contributions\n0\nOMG the Coconut Coffee is insanely good - amazingly brilliant - a must try!!!!\nAug 2019\nAs an vegan I cannot find a good coffee with almond milk or soya milk usually. So my partner and I decided to try out a coconut coffee. We observed the coffee being made with the coconut milk. It was a lovely, sweet, cold and placed into a long ice- coffee glass.\n\nThe coffee beans in Vietnam have a nice and strong flavour without being bitter. It was a lovely, refreshing, sweet and great for a really hot day. It fact, this coffee was that good that we had four of these coffee within two days. I did not feel sickly after drinking this. It energised me during our flight arrivals and departures. We will definitely returning to this place again. It was a cheap, but a worthwhile option which we enjoyed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 29, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
